    {
      "id": "u003",
      "speaker": "user",
      "speaker_id": "user_1",
      "text": "他这周都改第三回了。",
      "start_at_ms": 6180,
      "end_at_ms": 8200
    },
    {
      "id": "u004",
      "speaker": "user",
      "speaker_id": "user_1",
      "text": "说改就改，一句话的事。",
      "start_at_ms": 8600,
      "end_at_ms": 10880
    },
    {
      "id": "u005",
      "speaker": "user",
      "speaker_id": "user_1",
      "text": "上周五刚定好的时间，昨天改一次，今天又改。",
      "start_at_ms": 11280,
      "end_at_ms": 15340
    },
    {
      "id": "u006",
      "speaker": "assistant",
      "speaker_id": "assistant",
      "text": "嗐",
      "start_at_ms": 12400,
      "end_at_ms": 13320
    },
    {
      "id": "u007",
      "speaker": "assistant",
      "speaker_id": "assistant",
      "text": "是啊！",
      "start_at_ms": 13600,
      "end_at_ms": 14400
    },
    {
      "id": "u008",
      "speaker": "user",
      "speaker_id": "user_1",
      "text": "我微信里还跟他确认过两遍。",
      "start_at_ms": 15740,
      "end_at_ms": 17680
    },
    {
      "id": "u009",
      "speaker": "user",
      "speaker_id": "user_1",
      "text": "我下午本来排了两个客户，现在只能往后挪，然后见了他们还得把方案初稿收掉的。",
      "start_at_ms": 18080,
      "end_at_ms": 24560
    },
    {
      "id": "u010",
      "speaker": "assistant",
      "speaker_id": "assistant",
      "text": "那真是够呛",
      "start_at_ms": 21600,
      "end_at_ms": 22840
    },
    {
      "id": "u011",
      "speaker": "user",
      "speaker_id": "user_1",
      "text": "初稿本来今天就该动笔了。",
      "start_at_ms": 24960,
      "end_at_ms": 26600
    },
    {
      "id": "u012",
      "speaker": "user",
      "speaker_id": "user_1",
      "text": "结果这一周，我光顾着跟着他改时间了。",
      "start_at_ms": 27000,
      "end_at_ms": 30060
    },
    {
      "id": "u013",
      "speaker": "assistant",
      "speaker_id": "assistant",
      "text": "唉，光耗在这上头了。",
      "start_at_ms": 28000,
      "end_at_ms": 29100
    },
    {
      "id": "u014",
      "speaker": "user",
      "speaker_id": "user_1",
      "text": "行了，我看看怎么调整吧。",
